<title>USA: McClatchy Newspapers Q4 shr rises.</title>
<headline>McClatchy Newspapers Q4 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>SACRAMENTO, Calif. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>McCLATCHY NEWSPAPERS, INC.</p>
<p>		  SUMMARY OF UNAUDITED RESULTS</p>
<p>		    (IN THOUSANDS, EXCEPT PER SHARE AMOUNTS)</p>
<p>					  Quarter Ended   Year Ended</p>
<p>					  December 31,   December 31,</p>
<p>				     1996     1995     1996	1995</p>
<p> Revenues - net	   $ 165,468$ 160,472 $ 624,233$ 540,879</p>
<p>Operating expenses:</p>
<p>   Compensation		64,952   62,493   253,327  225,505</p>
