<p>				   32,567   29,612   120,001  104,413</p>
<p>Total operating expenses</p>
<p>				  135,164  139,220   538,998  478,505</p>
<p> Operating income	    30,304   21,252    85,235   62,374</p>
<p> Investment income		 26	 92	 102    3,925</p>
