<p>				     0.46     0.27	1.18     0.90</p>
<p>Weighted average common</p>
<p>  shares (A)		   37,999   37,568    37,812   37,529</p>
<p>NOTES: (A)  Share and per share amounts have been adjusted to reflect a five-for-four stock split declared in December 1996 and paid on January 2, 1997.</p>
<p>Earnings in the latest quarter include a net after-tax gain of about $0.04 a share from the sale of various small business operations.  Earnings in the fourth quarter of 1995 include an after-tax charge of about $0.04 a share for early retirement programs.</p>
<p>Without these non-recurring items net income for fiscal 1996 and fiscal 1995 would have been $42.9 million and $35.2 million respectively.</p>
